<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan yarn merchants closed in anti-tax protest.</title>
<headline>Pakistan yarn merchants closed in anti-tax protest.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pakistan Yarn Merchants Association said on Sunday it had not issued closing rates because yarn merchants had kept their businesses shut in protest at higher taxes in the 1996/97 (July-June) budget.</p>
<p>The yarn shops are likely to reopen on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
